# A queue file: one suite path per line, run in order, `#` comments ignored.
# Paths resolve against this file's directory, so the queue travels with the
# suites it names.
#
#   rig queue -inventory driver/example/inventory-local.json \
#             -results results -bin bin driver/example/example.queue
#
# `rig doctor` runs before each suite; the journal is results/queue.json, and
# `rig watch -results results -queue` follows it.
suite-smoke.json
suite-ramp.json
